cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release."
title: "TeoriaTeotl: computational demonstrations for Teotl Field Theory"
abstract: >-
  Runnable checks accompanying the Teotl Field Theory programme: a phase field on
  ordinary space and time, from which the code derives or tests electromagnetism,
  emergent gravity, the galactic acceleration scale, quantum-correlation results
  (CHSH closure, Born rule, number-phase uncertainty), and the particle sector.
  Each script is standalone, prints its own result, and states what it establishes.
  The repository is deliberately a dated record: scripts and gate notes are not
  rewritten when a later audit changes a reading; corrections are carried in banners,
  and DERIVED_SUMMARY.md holds the current status of every claim.
type: software
authors:
